Z||000022||rogergarrison||07-20-2001||05:49 AM||||Ive seen every model of Ferrari in person. I still dont like the looks of anything newer than the 355 series. my favs still are the 308, GTO, BB512, Daytona and the 62 250 GTO. mmmmmmm oh and the 57 Testa Rossa (pontoon fendered) and 250 California and........ <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">Only thing I like is the headlite setup and the visible engine (im sure this was a gimic) on the Modena. Of course Im only refering to the body styling.||||reg||1
